"title":"吳王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"self_proclamation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p029","quote":"夫槩亡歸吳而自立爲吳王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji031-012:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p029","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"吳王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0062","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"self_proclamation","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p029","quote":"夫槩亡歸吳而自立爲吳王。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授予、自立與用稱分開；日期只錄原表述，不以死亡自動終止官爵。夫槩自立與闔廬爭位分存，不選唯一合法王號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji040-084","person_id":"cbr-p001983","surfaces":["夫概"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p050","quote":"昭王之出郢也，使申鮑胥請救於秦。秦以車五百乘救楚，楚亦收餘散兵，與秦撃呉。十一年六月，敗呉於稷。會呉王弟夫概見呉王兵傷敗，乃亡歸，自立爲王。闔閭聞之，引兵去楚，歸撃夫概。夫概敗，奔楚，楚封之堂谿，號爲堂谿氏。"}],"rationale":"依本段明示人物與職事暫定；未與他篇同稱候選自動合併，原字及疑名保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji040-fugai","person_ids":["cbr-p001067","cbr-p001983"],"canonical_person_id":"cbr-p001067","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu","c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p029","quote":"十年春，越聞吳王之在郢，國空，乃伐吳。吳使別兵撃越。楚告急秦，秦遣兵救楚撃吳，吳師敗。闔廬弟夫槩見秦越交敗吳，吳王留楚不去，夫槩亡歸吳而自立爲吳王。闔廬聞之，乃引兵歸，攻夫槩。夫槩敗奔楚。楚昭王乃得以九月復入郢，而封夫槩於堂谿，爲堂谿氏。十一年，吳王使太子夫差伐楚，取番。楚恐而去郢徙鄀。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0046","c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0062","c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0085","c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0088","c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0108"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shi